etyourguide.com/asturias-l2196/cangas-de-onis-descent-sella-river-exclusive-4km-t397525/","https://www.manawa.com/en-GB/activity/spain/cangas-de-onis/kayaking-canoeing/kayaking-on-the-sella-river-from-cangas-de-onis-asturias/7821","https://www.cangasaventura.com/en/activities/sella-river-descent/","https://www.sellavirtual.com/en/sella-river-canoe-descent-2025/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Ruta del Cares gorge walk","type":"trail","detail":"Cliff-cut path between Poncebos and Cain threads tunnels and bridges above the Cares gorge, about 12 km each way.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.packing-up-the-pieces.com/cares-gorge-hike/","https://www.moonhoneytravel.com/picos-de-europa-hiking/","https://anywhereweroam.com/picos-de-europa-spain/","https://www.picuco.com/en-es/blog/picos-de-europa-in-summer-10-hikes-viewpoints-and-bases-to","https://zannavandijk.co.uk/best-hikes-in-picos-de-europa/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Lagos de Covadonga and sanctuary","type":"trail","detail":"Easy loop past glacial lakes Enol and Ercina in high pasture, paired with the cliffside basilica and holy cave below.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":21,"urls":["https://theabroadguide.com/excursion-to-the-picos-de-europa-lakes-of-covadonga-and-sanctuary/","https://inbetweentravels.com/covadonga-lakes/","https://bellasboldadventures.com/lakes-of-covadonga-my-encounter-with-glacial-beauty-and-sacred-legends-high-in-the-picos-de-europa/","https://www.picuco.com/en-es/blog/picos-de-europa-in-summer-10-hikes-viewpoints-and-bases-to","https://www.turismoasturias.es/en/-/blogs/las-10-mejores-cosas-que-ver-y-hacer-en-la-comarca-de-picos-de-europa"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Fuente De cable car to Horcados Rojos","type":"experience","detail":"Four-minute cable car lifts you 750 m onto the central massif; a ridgeline path continues to the Horcados Rojos viewpoint.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":21,"urls":